      "text": "[6:21PM] #Alausa_Ikeja #TrafficUpdate \n\nSmooth traffic flow on Obafemi Awolowo Way, from Barrack to Ikeja underneath the bridge, via Coca-Cola Junction, Radio, Allen Junction, and Balogun, with only slight delays at alternation points.\nUnimpeded movement on Mobolaji Johnson Avenue, from Dr. Nurudeen Olowopopo to Otedola underneath the bridge, and Aromire to Adeniyi Jones, linking to Hacco.\nGood traffic conditions on Lateef Jakande Road, from Coca-Cola Junction to Omole Roundabout, as well as on Hakeem Balogun, Ashabi Cole, Governors Road, and Governors Avenue.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
