      "text": "[6:45PM] #Sangotedo #TrafficUpdate \n\nGood movement from under the bridge to Alesh, with a smooth return journey.\nUnimpeded traffic from under the bridge to Ado Road, Thomas Junction, and back.\nGood traffic flow from under the bridge to Adesanya, and from Adesanya to Ogombo Road.\nSmooth movement on the Adesanya stretch, covering HFP, Alasia, Olokonla, Jonaith, Ogidan, ShopRite, Abijo, Awoyaya, Bogije, Igando, Abulepanu, and Eleko.\nGood return journey from Eleko to under the bridge, covering the entire stretch.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
